Recorder calls can be chained. The recorded snapshots list the selection after each move:
here two hops out from "A" reach first "B" and "E", then "C":

::: {#bb87e616 .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
graph = ec.Graph(directed=True).add_edges(
    [("A", "B"), ("B", "C"), ("C", "D"), ("A", "E")],
    auto_create_nodes=True,
)

rec = (
    graph.record_traversal()
    .select_nodes_by_id([graph.get_id_from_label("A")])
    .trav_out()
    .trav_out()
)

[
    (step["op_display"], sorted(graph.get_label_from_id(i) for i in step["ids"]))
    for step in rec.steps
]
